<speak>My <sub alias="eff eye en">FIN</sub> is <sub alias="gee">G</sub> four two eight two one zero zero <sub alias="dee">D</sub>. My date of birth is the eleventh of July nineteen sixty-nine. I have taken the other papers out of the folder already. For the conversation, I would like the formal parts to be kept distinct from the general discussion. Sometimes I talk about how I organise things, and that can sound more decisive than I mean it to. A small pause between sections helps me keep my notes tidy.</speak>